## Search Tree - Continuation

%%col 50 50

*Step 5:* 3 < 12 and 3 < 6
```
   12
  /  \
 6    18
/    /
3   15
```

%%sep

*Step 7:* 9 < 12 but 9 > 6
```
   12
  /  \
 6    18
/ \  /  \
3  9 15  21
```

%%/col


%%col 50 50

*Step 6:* 21 > 12 and 21 > 18
```
   12
  /  \
 6    18
/    /  \
3   15   21
```

%%sep

*Finished search tree!*

